+    "Every other option Madeira reads from madeira.cfg. JIT pool, video memory, the swap tier, the sync engine and eco mode are in Settings › Memory & sync; the Direct3D 9/12 routes, the Vulkan driver and windowed mode in Settings › Display and Graphics. Most options are read when Madeira starts, so close it from the app switcher after a change. Default leaves the option out of the file. Swipe left on a row to reset it.": {
